    <string name="ui_scenario_movie_hint">Smart cinema and HEVC preference. Capture capped at 60 submissions/s. Suggested Moonlight: 1080p60, HEVC, 30–50 Mbps. Sound and input remain your choice.</string>
    <string name="ui_scenario_game_hint">Whole screen, up to 120 capture submissions/s. Suggested Moonlight: 1080p60, 20–40 Mbps. Enable input separately if needed.</string>
    <string name="ui_scenario_eco_hint">Whole screen, at most 30 capture submissions/s. Suggested Moonlight: 720p30, 8–15 Mbps. Actual power use depends on the device.</string>
